{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXBa322Rrjyvqe9A4vb", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**1997 年**(1997 年 1 月)。\n\n搜索结果说,医院由原中国中医研究院骨伤科研究所、北京针灸骨伤学院附属医院和骨伤系合并组建,并在 1997 年 1 月建院。我只搜了一次,结果里没有\"挂牌\"这个词本身,也没找到具体挂牌日期。所以\"挂牌\"就是这个时间,是我按建院时间推断的。\n\nSources:\n- [网易号:望京网相关文章](https://www.163.com/dy/article/L3JET7ME0552UVCI.html)\n- [TCL 望京医院案例页](https://www.tcl.com/cn/zh/tclbusiness/client-cases/wangjing)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 983, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4292, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 983}, "output_tokens": 9, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:52:54.251Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXBZkA2hqX4yBgZFVPv"}
